From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:40:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] arcana: 0044-dependent-target-owned-by-target-controller

DependentTargetSelection now treats OwnedByReferencedPlayer(TargetController)
("target artifact card in that player's graveyard", where that player is
the controller of the first target) as a dependent slot: the card slot is
enumerated per chosen first target (validTargetsByPrefix), the ability is
offered only when a legal pair exists, and a mismatched pair is rejected.
Before, the slot was evaluated with no first target and found nothing, so
Goblin Welder was never offered.
---
 .../wingedsheep/engine/handlers/DependentTargetSelection.kt | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/DependentTargetSelection.kt b/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/DependentTargetSelection.kt
index d525cf6e04..c2f1e6b19f 100644
--- a/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/DependentTargetSelection.kt
+++ b/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/DependentTargetSelection.kt
@@ -50,7 +50,11 @@ object DependentTargetSelection {
         // "target cards from target player's graveyard" (Drafna's Restoration, Quandrix Command):
         // the card slot can't be offered until the player slot is chosen.
         ControllerPredicate.OwnedByTargetPlayer -> true
-        is ControllerPredicate.OwnedByReferencedPlayer -> isTargetReference(predicate.target)
+        // "target artifact a player controls and target artifact card in **that player's**
+        // graveyard" (Goblin Welder): the owner is the controller of the first target, so the
+        // graveyard slot can't be offered until the permanent slot is chosen.
+        is ControllerPredicate.OwnedByReferencedPlayer ->
+            isTargetReference(predicate.target) || predicate.target == EffectTarget.TargetController
         else -> false
     }
 
